Q5. What is the difference between DELETE, TRUNCATE, and DROP?

Answer-

DELETE → removes rows, can use WHERE, can rollback.

TRUNCATE → removes all rows (faster, resets auto-increment), cannot rollback in some DBs.

DROP → removes entire table structure and data.
